Interface files used as test fixtures.

Each folder holds one ROS 2 package's .msg, .srv and .action files with its package.xml, which
names the license. The ROS packages are copied unchanged from ROS 2 Jazzy, so that the tests
run without a ROS install.

std_msgs, geometry_msgs, sensor_msgs, nav_msgs, std_srvs
    Apache-2.0, https://github.com/ros2/common_interfaces
builtin_interfaces, rcl_interfaces, action_msgs
    Apache-2.0, https://github.com/ros2/rcl_interfaces
unique_identifier_msgs
    BSD, https://github.com/ros2/unique_identifier_msgs
tf2_msgs
    BSD, https://github.com/ros2/geometry2
nav2_msgs
    Apache-2.0, https://github.com/ros-navigation/navigation2
vision_msgs
    Apache-2.0, https://github.com/ros-perception/vision_msgs

g1_msgs, canopy_msgs
    BSD-3-Clause, the author's own interfaces, from the grove-g1 repository
    (https://github.com/Adyansh04/grove-g1) and its canopy submodule
    (https://github.com/Adyansh04/canopy).

The reference results in ../golden/ are made from these files by ../../tools/dump_golden.py.
